The definitions reside in `GameStatistics.cs`; the only call sites are in `RoomManager.cs`. `RecordRoomVisited()` is called once on the first room entry (guarded by `_isFirstEnter`), and `RecordRoomCleared()` is called when a room is fully cleared, right before `OnRoomCleared?.Invoke()`.

